                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 812.00/1838.</note>
                <head>[Untitled]</head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Mexico</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1911-05-18"><hi rendition="#italic">May 18,
                        1911</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>At 11 o’clock last night the armistice between the Government and the
                    revolutionists went into effect.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Wilson.</hi></signed></closer>
